# The hero's left-facing jump sheet: 13 frames, shared bank.
#
# Index is the play order of HERO_JUMP_LEFT_FROM_STAND (CAVES) and
# PRISON_HERO_WALK_JUMP_LEFT (PRISON), which draw the same twelve offsets in
# the same order; ascending offset order agrees, which is the check.
# F07 is drawn only by the from-run entry (HERO_JUMP_LEFT_FROM_RUN /
# PRISON_HERO_RUN_JUMP_LEFT), which holds it for two frames -- it is the deep
# part of the arc a standing hop never reaches.
#
# Airborne frames by airborne_in_art.py (bottom edge above the +0.5 modal
# ground level): F06 at -7.0 and F08 at -3.5 for the standing hop; the
# running jump is airborne across F05..F08.
CV_52C0 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F00
CV_52E0 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F01
CV_5300 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F02
CV_5320 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F03
CV_5340 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F04
CV_5360 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F05
CV_5380 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F06
CV_53A0 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F07
CV_53C0 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F08
CV_53E0 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F09
CV_5400 HERO_JUMP_LEFT_F10
